// 解説 (answer explanations) for every question that is not asked about a reading passage: 漢字読み・文脈規定・
// 言い換え類義・用法・文法形式の判断・文の組み立て, and each blank of 文章の文法 (keyed "<question id>_<blank index>").
// Written by Claude (not from the book), in the style of MOCK_EX in app.*.js: the point being tested, why the keyed
